WEBVTT

00:04:57.829 --> 00:05:00.116
kateterizimin kardiak.

00:05:00.116 --> 00:05:02.533
Nuk tregoi bllokim.

00:05:02.533 --> 00:05:04.605
Simptomat e Lindes vazhduan.

00:05:04.605 --> 00:05:07.078
Ajo u detyrua te linte punen.

00:05:07.078 --> 00:05:09.830
Atehere ajo na gjeti ne.

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:13.978
Kur erdhi te ne, beme nje kateterizim kardiak tjeter

00:05:13.978 --> 00:05:17.395
dhe kesaj radhe gjetem shenja.

00:05:17.395 --> 00:05:19.869
Por na duhej nje test tjeter

00:05:19.869 --> 00:05:22.463
te benim diagnozen.

00:05:22.463 --> 00:05:27.043
Beme nje test qe quhet ultrasaund intrakoronar

00:05:27.043 --> 00:05:29.348
qe perdor valet e zerit per te pare ne arteret

00:05:29.348 --> 00:05:32.079
nga brenda jashte.